      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "location_description"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Cadogan is part of Cadogan Township in Armstrong County, an area that boasts 15 historic sites including museums and preserved landmarks.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://experiencearmstrong.org/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The county’s outdoor scene features over 200 miles of trails, the Allegheny River, and fishing spots, making it a hub for hiking, biking, and paddling.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        27
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://experiencearmstrong.org/",
      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Armstrong County hosts festivals, live music, food and wine tastings, and arts and crafts, creating a vibrant cultural calendar.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://visitbradfordcounty.com/",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "French Azilum Historic Site, nearby, offers wellness days and hands‑on history experiences like blacksmithing.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6,
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://visitbradfordcounty.com/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
